      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 71
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Har insaan ke andar ek silent pressure continuously chalta rehta hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 72
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "jo kabhi visible nahi hota, par har moment ko shape karta rehta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 73
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ye pressure ek simple sa question se start hota hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 74
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“Main kya banunga?”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 75
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lekin agar is question ko sirf thought na samjha jaye…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 76
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh ye ek psychological architecture hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 77
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek invisible structure jo present ko hold karta hai…"
